+   git remote add origin YOUR_GITHUB_REPO
+   git push -u origin main
+   ```
+
+2. **Deploy on Vercel**
+   - Go to [vercel.com](https://vercel.com)
+   - Click "Import Project"
+   - Select your GitHub repo
+   - Deploy! (automatic)
